{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51754","headline":"献贺捷诗（孟知祥入梓州，举子勾龙逢献诗云云，孟知祥嘉纳之。） · 勾龙逢","name":"献贺捷诗（孟知祥入梓州，举子勾龙逢献诗云云，孟知祥嘉纳之。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"唇齿论交岁月长，岂其率意忽颠狂。\n元戎统领三军战，巨孽奔冲一阵亡。\n莫讶潼江刚入寇，都缘锦浦合兴王。\n武功盖世光前後，堪向青编万古扬。\n（《全五代诗》五七引《十国春秋》）（〖1〗见《监诫录》卷一《知机对》、《十国春秋》卷四八《後蜀高祖本纪》。\n孟知祥入梓州，爲长兴三年五月间事。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"勾龙逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}